@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title repo-documentation — Impact Check, Canonical Ownership and Diagram Routing

start
:Run documentation impact check;

if (Documented behavior, architecture, interface,\nworkflow, dependency or diagram changed?) then (no)
  :Record no documentation change needed;
  stop
endif

:Find canonical owner document;

if (Owner exists?) then (yes)
  :Update canonical owner;
else (no)
  :Create one focused owner document;
endif

:Update documentation router when needed;

if (Diagram materially improves understanding?) then (yes)
  :Invoke plantuml capability;
  :Create / update focused .puml\nand same-basename SVG;
  :Embed SVG with descriptive alt text;
  :Link editable .puml source;
else (no)
  :Keep explanation in prose / tables;
endif

:Check duplicate facts + orphaned docs;
:Record documentation result in delivery evidence;
stop
@enduml
